          "body": "Thanks. The spec has original and then larger Zip64 sizes introduced later. The `proto_tree_add_item_ret_uint64()` function doesn't allow using field types smaller than `FT_UINT40`, which is why I just used one field instead of two with the same abbreviation. I wonder if it should just allow that?",
